{
  "name": "Arithmetic",
  "comment": "8086 ALU group — 8 ops (ADD/OR/ADC/SBB/AND/SUB/XOR/CMP) across 6 forms (r/m,r 8/16-bit + r,r/m 8/16-bit + AL/AX,imm). 48 opcodes total at 0x00-0x3D, slotted between PUSH/POP sreg (06/07/0E/16/17/1E/1F) and segment override prefixes (26/2E/36/3E) which are wired in the data-transfer group. Each ALU op shares one IR emitter (x86_alu_w8 / x86_alu_w16) parameterised by `kind`; flag rules (CF/PF/AF/ZF/SF/OF) live in X86AluHelpers.\n\n0x80-0x83 group ALU r/m,imm forms + TEST + INC/DEC + NOT/NEG/MUL/IMUL/DIV/IDIV defer to 24.6.6b/c.",

  "formats": [
